sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant W as Workflow
    participant III as III Engine
    participant E as Express Worker
    participant H as Hono Worker
    participant K as Koa Worker
    participant F as Fastify Worker

    Client->>W: POST /order
    W->>III: invokeFunction users.get
    III->>E: users.get
    E-->>III: user
    III-->>W: user
    
    W->>III: invokeFunction products.get
    III->>H: products.get
    H-->>III: product
    III-->>W: product
    
    W->>III: invokeFunction inventory.get
    III->>K: inventory.get
    K-->>III: stock
    III-->>W: stock
    
    W->>III: invokeFunction orders.create
    III->>F: orders.create
    F-->>III: order
    III-->>W: order
    
    W->>III: invokeFunction inventory.set
    III->>K: inventory.set
    K-->>III: updated
    III-->>W: updated
    
    W-->>Client: Complete response
